- content_for :title, "Illinois Data Bank"
- content_for :hide_page_title, true

%section#welcome-image{style: "background-image: url('#{asset_path('orange_data_banner_2021-08-05.png')}')"}
  #welcome-overlay
    %ul.list-unstyled
      %li.welcome-item
        The
        %h1.welcome-title Illinois Data Bank
        is a public access repository for publishing research data from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign.
      %li.welcome-item
        %a{href: "/guides#desirable_characteristics"} Learn how we meet trustworthy repository standards

%section#welcome-body
  .welcome-main
    %h2 You are ready to deposit data if:
    %ul
      %li Your data is in a final state and not expected to undergo revisions.
      %li You have removed any private, confidential, or legally protected information.
      %li You are a faculty member, staff member, or graduate student at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign.
      %li You have permission to publicly distribute data from all creators and copyright owners.

    %h2 Published data:
    %ul
      %li Is open to anyone in the world.
      %li Receives a stable DOI for easy reference and citation.
      %li Is readily available for a minimum of 5 years.
      %li Is stored in a stable environment that complies with funder and publisher requirements.

  .welcome-spotlight
    %h2 Researcher Spotlight
    .featured-bio
      .photo-preview
        %img{src: "https://uofi.box.com/shared/static/09a7yq9bgzlformr3k33ocfoqw4632jy.png",
             class: "img-responsive",
             alt: "Headshot of Lindsay Clark"}
      %strong Lindsay Clark
      %p
        I am a plant geneticist with particular interests in polyploidy, population genetics, and the development of novel algorithms and software for the analysis of molecular markers. I am currently a research specialist in the lab of Prof. Erik Sacks in the Department of Crop Sciences at the University of Illinois, Urbana-Champaign.

    .featured-buttons
      %a.ilw-button{href: "#", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", "aria-label": "dataset provided by Lindsay Clark"}
        dataset
      %a.ilw-button{href: "#", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", "aria-label": "article provided by Lindsay Clark"}
        article

    .featured-comment
      %strong How did you decide the Data Bank was the best place to put the data?
      .elbow
        %p
          The Data Bank is free, and it allows any type of data, which is great. We liked that we could put essentially any information in there that we wanted.

    %hr
    %p
      %a{href: "/researcher_spotlights"} See all researcher spotlights
